# Clinician Adoption Model

Technology adoption succeeds when clinicians trust the system.

## Stages of Adoption
1. Awareness – Understanding why change is needed
2. Acceptance – Seeing value in daily workflows
3. Adoption – Regular usage
4. Advocacy – Clinicians promote usage to peers

## Enablers
- Respect for clinical time
- Minimal disruption
- Transparent communication
- Feedback incorporation

## Key Insight
Adoption improves when clinicians feel technology is **working with them**, not monitoring them.
